    {% if _pGag and (_pNeedDrink or _pNeedFood) and _closeToPlayer and _speakerCanStrip and _lockTargetUUID == player.UUID %}
    - {{ player_name }} is gagged and{% if _pNeedDrink %} parched{% endif %}{% if _pNeedFood %} starving{% endif %}. The mouth is in the way of that. MUST pick `BDSMUNLOCK` `{"intent": "gag {{ player_name }}"}` this line. She did not have to ask.
