    - Occupancy above is physics for {{ _lockTargetName }} specifically. A memory that she "already wears a chastity belt" is stale if `belt` is not in that list. If {{ _lockTargetName }} asked for chastity / a metal belt and belt is not occupied AND {{ npc.name }} agreed, pick `BDSMLOCK` with `{"intent": "chastity belt {{ _lockTargetName }}"}`.
